Когда run Quality "Quality: Translucency.Refraction HardwareTraced"
Когда frames 256
Когда profile-dump
Тогда-вид day_rt day, HardwareTraced under Reflections.TranslucentFrontLayer 0: the preset row does not stop it - the refracted interior behind the shop window, day_rt vs day_rt_mute on the glass at least 2x day_rt vs day_rt_b (mean |delta| over the pane mask, see the head); editor.log has no line "the glass refracts the scene copy"; profile-dump: "Translucency: Ray Traced Refraction" executed with a non-zero GPU time, the window rule holds against the day_ss dump (GPU frame within 2x, ClearMainFramebuffer <= 0.2 ms); the knockout 56.97 against 3.57 in scn-1128-094916
